 "summary": "The general equation and its chosen-Frobenius corollary have no counterpart in Mathlib (whose cyclotomic Galois file only bounds the decomposition group by `zpowers (ZMod.unitOfCoprime p hn)`) or in TauCeti (whose `isArithFrobAt_iff_galEquivZMod_eq_absNorm` is the `\ud835\udcde \u211a`/`absNorm` form, reused here rather than reproved). The fifth-cyclotomic computations instantiate the new lemma and do not overlap `FiveSplitting.lean` or `WorkedExamples/FifthCyclotomic/Invariants.lean`.",
